title: DumbQuestion_Encounter
---
Customer: Hey, sorry... quick question.
Customer: If a product doesn't have a barcode, is it free?

-> Explain that no, it still has to be paid for
    Player: No, every product gets charged, whether it has a visible code or not.
    Customer: Ah, too bad. Worth a shot though.
    <<jump DumbQuestion_End>>

-> Play along with the joke
    Player: Shhh, don't tell anyone, but yes.
    Customer: Awesome! Wait... are you joking?
    <<jump DumbQuestion_End>>

-> Ignore the question and keep working
    Customer: ...Hello?
    Customer: Ok, I get the hint.
    <<jump DumbQuestion_End>>

===

title: DumbQuestion_End
